# INVWINVA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: a reservation
# at level 2 (CLERK).  CTRL+R on item 2, two drives, shows a new
# reservation of it, its maker and model beside its ID, quantity 1;
# without a holder or a host the server refuses it on the holder, and
# given one, "Club show", and a date out, it is added, noted on the
# status bar.  Item 2's form says one unit reserved.  Items > Loans and
# holds lists it among the open rows of all kinds; CTRL-PGDN filters
# the loans, none, then the reservations, it alone, each named in the
# title.  Return or release (ALT-C R) asks to release the reservation,
# and ENTER releases it, noted; CTRL-PGDN three times shows every row,
# the released one too, and item 2's form says both units are available
# again.  The end by Exit.  Every date is typed, so that no snapshot
# holds the day of the run.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINVA.SNP is its
# snapshot.
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER
K DOWN CTRL-R
S NEW
K ENTER
S NOHOLDER
T Club show
# past the host and the contact to the date out
K TAB TAB TAB
T 2026-10-01
K ENTER
S ADDED
K ENTER
S HELD
K ESC ALT-I O
S LIST
K CPGDN
S LOANS
K CPGDN
S RESERVED
K ALT-C R
S ASKEND
T 2026-10-02
K ENTER
S RELEASED
K CPGDN CPGDN CPGDN
S ALL
K ALT-I I DOWN ENTER
S FREE
K ESC ALT-F X
